{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1492787-tc-2e-antagonists-listing","id":1492787,"title":"[TC 2E] Antagonists listing","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-09-10T23:50:33-07:00","id":1492787,"title":"[TC 2E] Antagonists listing","content":"Is there some ready antagonists listing for <b>Trinity</b> 2E books? If not, could you answer me where can I find stats for...<br /> <br /> Gang members or troop soldiers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-11T06:40:22-07:00","id":1492800,"title":"","content":"On Onyx Path official Discord, they pointed me to the <b>Minor Characters and Threats</b> rules in <b>Trinity Core</b> p. 139-140. So here are my propositions for those...<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Bandits, Gangs &amp; Soldiers</b></span><br /> <br /> Those type of characters are Minor Characters, based on their Primary Pool as Power level. Here is write-ups for them\u2026<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Bandits \u2013 Minor Character, Power 5</b></span><br /> <br /> They are typical, day-to-day criminals \u2013 lower thieves and extortionists, often working for larger criminal organisations, like Mafia families.<br /> <br /> <b>Primary Pool: </b>5 (Thievery and Firearms ) or ( Extortion and Close Combat)<br /> <b>Secondary Pool:</b> 3 (Intimidation, Hiding)<br /> <b>Desperation Pool: </b>2<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 2<br /> <b>Enhancement:</b> 0<br /> <b>Equipment:</b><br /> <b><i>Telescopic Baton</i></b> ( Extortion and Close Combat +0 Enhancement )<br /> <b><i>Handgun</i> </b>( Firearms +0 Enhancement )<br /> <b><i>Thieves tools</i></b> ( Thievery +0 Enhancement )<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Gangs \u2013 Minor Character, Power 6</b></span><br /> <br /> Gangs are small family-like criminal organisations that need to survive day-to-day on streets on larger cities. They often are much more violent than typical thieves or even Mafia extortionists.<br /> <br /> <b>Primary Pool: </b>6 ( Extortion, Close Combat and Firearms )<br /> <b>Secondary Pool:</b> 3 ( Thievery, Intimidation, Hiding )<br /> <b>Desperation Pool: </b>2<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 2<br /> <b>Enhancement:</b> 0<br /> <b>Equipment:</b><br /> <b><i>Knives</i></b> ( Extortion and Close Combat +0 Enhancement )<br /> <b><i>Handgun</i> </b>( Firearms +0 Enhancement )<br /> <b>Short Machine Gun \u2013 SMGs </b>( Rare, Firearms +1 Enhancement )<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Soldiers \u2013 Minor Character, Power 7</b></span><br /> <br /> Soldiers are most often official government contracted fighters. Having support of countries budget on arms and training, they are professionals in art of combat. Mercenaries are most often still ex-country contracted soldiers, going from the same training.<br /> <br /> <b>Primary Pool: </b>7 ( Close Combat, Firearms and Intimidating )<br /> <b>Secondary Pool:</b> 4 ( First Aid, Hiding, Scouting )<br /> <b>Desperation Pool: </b>2<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 2<br /> <b>Enhancement:</b> 0<br /> <b>Equipment:</b><br /> <b><i>Knives</i></b> ( Intimidating and Close Combat +1 Enhancement )<br /> <b><i>Handgun</i> </b>( Firearms +1 Enhancement )<br /> <b><i>Professional Guns</i> </b>( Rare, Firearms +2 Enhancement )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}